      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRINCESS TILLEY (8) produced a slick 19.67 when filling a minor placing over 342m at this track last start. In form and rates on top this time. LOVING IT SWEET (7) goes very well here starting 23 times for eight wins and 12 minors. In the money last time at this track (19.84) in a Grade 3/4, finishing a 3.5 lengths third. Can feature in the finish. BINNAWAY WIZARD (5) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (20.09) in a Grade 3/4 at this track. Form here sound including six wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Has the ability to give this a shake. DAYNE'S CALAIS (1) was a winner two back and strongly fancied last time but could only manage fourth (22.90) at Gawler. Has good early burn and is suited drawn on the inside.",
